<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Tito</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tito</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa Tito</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1"/>Balua yi' niandike nenga na Pauli, ntumisi wa Nnu'ngu' na ntumilwe wa Yesu Kilisitu. Nitumilwe kwa kitumbu sa kwayi'gana bandu babasaulilwe na Nnu'ngu' li'nga bapate kumwu'bi'lya no tanga ukakape waulu'a kwalongoya tama maisa magolou, <verse eid="TIT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2"/>na kwapeya mau'bi'lyo go li'nda ukoto wangayomoka. Nnu'ngu', ywangali longela ubu'su', aalagi ukoto wo kubile balo ata umbilwa kwa dunia. <verse eid="TIT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3"/>Lakini, munsimu wake Nnu'ngu' aumukwi liyi'gi'yo lyake. Naakamukiyilwe nwaya liyi'gi'yo lyo na Nnu'ngu', Nkosopoli witu.<verse eid="TIT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4"/>Nikuandikya wa Tito, wamwana wangu' wa kakape muimani yatuiu'bi'lya. Nikulu'bya ngu'ngu' na amani bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' na Kilisitu Yesu, Nkosopoli witu.<verse eid="TIT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lyengo lya Tito ku Kilete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5"/>Naakulei kunni'ma wa Kilete li'nga ubi'ke wiso makowe gagaaigile, pamope no sawa api'ndo ba kanisa kwa kila kilambo, kati mu'lu' mwanaakulagile. <verse eid="TIT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6"/>Mpi'ndo wa kanisa apalikwa kaneabe na lukoolo na mundu, abe nnalu'me wa nnwawa yumo. Bana bake bapalikwa babe babau'bi'lile bangali sitakilwa kwa makowe ga umbu'ku'su' wala kotoka yu'wa. <verse eid="TIT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7"/>Nnyi'mi'li'ki wa kanisa apalikwa panga mundu ywangali bi'ki'lwa lukoolo kwa mwanjaa akamukiyilwe lyengo lya Nnu'ngu'. Kwa nyo kaneabe mundu ywakwipuna, ywayu'ngu'ya usika, nnobya wi'mbi', mwene nnomo wala pala mbanje kwa ndi'la ndau. <verse eid="TIT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8"/>Ila abe mundu ywapenda kwapokya ageni wiso, ywapenda panga makowe manogau, mwene ikima, mwene aki, mpeleteu na ywawesa kwiyi'mi'li'ka mwene. <verse eid="TIT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9"/>Apalikwa kamwa Liyi'gi'yo lya kakape kati mwaliyi'ganilwa, li'nga awese kwakangamaya bi'ngi' kwa mayi'gano ga kakape na kwakalipya balu' babagataukya mayi'gano ago.<verse eid="TIT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10"/>Kwa mwanjaa babile bandu baingi, muno balu' babau'bi'lile bu'ka mudini ya Kiyahudi, bembe bayu'wali na baaobeya bi'ngi' kwa mayi'gi'yo ga kilalo. <verse eid="TIT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11"/>Bapalikwa bakanikiyilwe, kwa mwanjaa baaobeya bandu bu'ka nsengo gumo ata wi'ngi' kwo yi'gana mayi'gi'yo gangali palikwa li'nga bapate mali kwa ndi'la ya ukongi. <verse eid="TIT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12"/>Kwaabile na nnondoli yumo ywabe Nkilete ywaabaite panga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="TIT 1:12">“Akilete masu'ba goti abu'su',</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="TIT 1:12">bapwaikali kati inyama ya mmwitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="TIT 1:12">bapendi mila muno</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="TIT 1:12">lakini bapendili panga kasi!”<verse eid="TIT 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13"/>Ukong'ondeli wu'no wa kakape. Kwa nyo wakwi'li'ke kwa ukali' li'nga bapate baa na imani yaitimile. <verse eid="TIT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14"/>Bakotoke pi'kania u'mo ya Kiyahudi yangali maana yoyoti, na malagyo ga bandu babaukana ukakape. <verse eid="TIT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15"/>Kwa balu' bababile na mwoyo nnogau, kila kili'be kwabe kipeleteu. Lakini ntu'pu' sosoti sakipanga kipeleteu kwa bandu asapu na bangali u'bi'lya Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa malango na myoyo yabe itwi'li usapu. <verse eid="TIT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16"/>Bembe babaya panga bantangite Nnu'ngu', lakini iyendo yabe ilaya mpu'la panga bendakunkana. Baatisukilwa, bangali yu'wa, na bangali pwaika mulikowe lyolyoti li'lu' linogau.<verse eid="TIT 1:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Mayi'gano ga kakape</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1"/>Lakini wenga wa Tito, upalikwa kwayi'gana bandu mayi'gano ga kakape. <verse eid="TIT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2"/>Waabakiye analu'me agoi bapange makowe kwo li'ngi'lya, babe na isima na bawese kwitawala bene. Kai', babe ba kakape muimani, muupendo na muukomeyi.<verse eid="TIT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3"/>Nyinyonyo waayi'gane alwawa agoi batame mumaisa mapeleteu. Kanebabe abai au babalobya, ila babe bandu bo yi'gana mayi'gi'yo manogau. <verse eid="TIT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4"/>Kwo panga nyo, babe kabaayi'gana alwawa ai'nja kwapenda asengo babe na bana babe, <verse eid="TIT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5"/>babe bandu babawesa kwitawala bene, apeleteu, babatunja wiso misengo yabe, anogau, babaayu'wa asengo babe, li'nga mundu ywoywoti aakane kulisalawa liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="TIT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6"/>Nyinyonyo waakong'ondeli na ansembe babe bandu babawesa kwitawala bene. <verse eid="TIT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7"/>Nawenga mumakowe gako goti upalikwa ulaye iyendo nogau li'nga uyigilwe, na kwo laya ukakape na isima mumayi'gano gako, <verse eid="TIT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8"/>no longela wisowiso pangali bi'ki'lwa lukoolo, li'nga babakutaukya bapate isika. Kwa nyo baapanga ntu'pu' likowe lyo longela lyalibile lyakau kwitu twenga.<verse eid="TIT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9"/>Waayi'gane abanda baayu'we angwana babe mumakowe goti, baapulaise na kanebataukane nabo, <verse eid="TIT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10"/>wala kanebayibe, ila balaye panga au'bi'li'ka, li'nga lyengo lyabe lyoti lyaapange bi'ngi' bautilwe na mayi'gano ga Nnu'ngu' Nkosopoli witu. <verse eid="TIT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11"/>Kwa mwanjaa ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' yaileta ukosopoli kwa bandu boti ibonekine. <verse eid="TIT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12"/>Ngu'ngu' yo ituyi'gana kana ulau na maminyikio ga dunia, li'nga tupate tama mumaisa ga kwitawala, ga aki, na mapeleteu munsimu wu'no, <verse eid="TIT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13"/>ku'no katulolela lisu'ba lyaliyaliwite lyatuliu'bi'lya, nsimu wawapitya utukupu wa Nnu'ngu' Nku'lu' na Nkosopoli witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="TIT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14"/>Ywembe aipiyite kwa kitumbu situ li'nga atuli'pi leni lya masambi goti na kutupanga twabandu apeleteu bake, bandu bene kilu'lu' so panga makowe manogau.<verse eid="TIT 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15"/>Bai, wayi'gane mayi'gi'yo ga, wakong'ondeli bandu na wakalipi kwa makakala goti. Mundu ywoywoti kaneakusalawe.<verse eid="TIT 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Maisa ga Kikilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1"/>Waaku'mbu'ki'ye bandu panga bapalikwa kwaisimu na kwayu'wa alongosi babaatawala. Mwibi'ke wiso kwa kila lyengo linogau. <verse eid="TIT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2"/>Waabakiye kanebantukane mundu ywoywoti, kanebayu'mane, ila babe anogau na atu'lya kwa bandu boti. <verse eid="TIT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3"/>Kwa mwanjaa twenga twabene nsimu nsi'si' twaabile twaalalo, twakingayu'wa, twaatikongelwa, na twaatabilwe na maminyikio ga kila sampuli. Twaatami muulau na bwigu, twaatisukilwa na twenga ngatusukwana twabene na bene. <verse eid="TIT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4"/>Lakini unogau na upendo wa Nnu'ngu', Nkosopoli witu pawaumukulilwe, <verse eid="TIT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5"/>aatukosopoli lili kwo pi'tya makowe gitu ga aki gatupangite, ila kwa kiya sake. Aatukosopoli kwa kutupeletea kwo belekwa kai' na kutupanga twayambi' kwa ndi'la ya Loo Mpeleteu. <verse eid="TIT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6"/>Nnu'ngu' atuulukiye Loo wake pangali li'ngi'lya kwo pi'tya Yesu Kilisitu Nkosopoli witu, <verse eid="TIT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7"/>li'nga tubalangilwe aki kwa ngu'ngu' yake, tupate panga twaalisi ku'no katuu'bi'lya tubile na ukoto wangayomoka.<verse eid="TIT 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8"/>Mayi'gi'yo gano ga kakape. Nikupala wenga ugakong'ondeli makowe ga, li'nga boti babamwu'bi'lya Nnu'ngu' babe na kilu'lu' so panga makowe manogau. Mayi'gi'yo go manogau kai' gakumpwaika kila mundu. <verse eid="TIT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9"/>Lakini utame kuutalu na nnomo au mataukyano ga kilogeloge bu'kana na salya au ngolo. Ago goti gapwaikali, kai', gabule bai. <verse eid="TIT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10"/>Mundu ywayu'mania bandu, unkwi'li'ke mala yimo au ata mala ibi'li', mana aakana kukuyu'wa ulekane nakwe mpamo. <verse eid="TIT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11"/>Utangite panga mundu kati ywo aulei ukakape, na sambi yake impwatya mwene.<verse eid="TIT 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mayi'gi'yo ga kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12"/>Nibini yenda tama kukilambo sa Nikapoli kwa wu'no nsimu woti wa mbepo, lakini naalu'a kuntuma Atema au Tikiko kasako, mana aikite akwo wenga waabini isa Nikapoli li'nga tukwembane. <verse eid="TIT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13"/>Ukondamie kunnyangatia Zena yu'lu' mundu wa salya, na Apolo. Waapei ili'be yoti yaipalikwa mumwanja wabe. <verse eid="TIT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14"/>Ayi' nga ndi'la yaipalikwa bandu bitu baiyi'gane panga makowe manogau, li'nga kwayangatiya apaali mumakowe go imukya. Kwo panga nyo, maisa gabe gaapangali gabule.<verse eid="TIT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15"/>Bandu boti bababile nanenga pano bendakusalimia. Tumbwelelo, na wenga kai' wasalimie aumini boti babatupenda muimani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' ibe pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="TIT 3:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3"/>
</usx>
